Creating the Story World —Writing Exercise 5  
■ Story World in One Line Use the designing  principle of ì to come ű a one -line 
description ¦ world.  
■ Overall Arena Define the overall arena and how you  will maintain ô arena throughout the 
story.  Remember ¶re are four main ways to do this:  
1. Create a large umbrella ¥n crosscut and  condense.  
